      "text": "Nintendo guided to ¥200,000 million in consolidated profit attributable to owners of parent for the year ending March 31, 2021, down 22.7% from the year ended March 31, 2020 (PDF pp. 2, 4). The prior-year comparison can be approximated as ¥200,000 million ÷ (1 − 0.227), but the percentage is rounded and p. 2 does not give the exact consolidated actual. The ¥210,842 million shown on p. 2 is non-consolidated profit.",
